@startuml
title Activity - UC-06 Phân tích & Thiết lập điểm đón tự động
start
:Admin trigger analysis;
:Load active enrollments (addresses, demand);
:Load constraints (walking distance, safety, zoning);

:Geocode / normalize addresses;
:Filter invalid/duplicate points;

repeat
  :Cluster by geography/demand (e.g., DBSCAN/KMeans);
  :Determine candidate centroid for cluster;
  :Score candidate by
   - coverage (students within radius)
   - safety/road type
   - accessibility;
repeat while (clusters remain?) is (yes)

:Select top-N candidates per area;
:De-duplicate overlapping candidates;
:Persist proposals to DB;

if (Admin manual adjust?) then (yes)
  :Drag/modify proposed stop on map;
  :Recalculate coverage and score;
endif

if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :Mark selected stops as APPROVED;
  :Publish event for downstream routing (UC-08);
else (no)
  :Keep proposals DRAFT for review;
endif
stop
@enduml